WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 1. Open End Point Insights and read the four evidence totals.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 1. Check the snapshot: older discoveries and missing evidence have different meanings.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Step 2. Open Missing details and inspect a field-level gap.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 2. The linked explorer shows the affected rows. Missing-field counts can overlap.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Step 3. Open Discovery evidence to check when records were observed and by which source.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.000
Step 3. Follow Older discoveries to review observations more than 30 days before the snapshot.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Step 4. Read Coverage context and its required tool-check denominator.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:52.000
Step 4. One CI can require several checks; CIs without required mappings are outside the percentage.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.500
Step 5. Investigate unidentified nodes in Shadow IT Explorer.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:05.000
Step 5. Return to the briefing and Generate PDF to share the evidence and next steps.
